14. WHAT NOT TO DO
- Open a second category before removals award weekly in Birmingham.
- Open a second city before the first is green on all four diagnostics.
- Sign up an out-of-corridor vendor into a Founding 25 slot to feel productive.
- Let a vendor accept or bid without license and COI on file.
- Show anyone's price to another vendor. Ever.
- Decide a dispute on a job you bid.
- Charge a seat fee before the corridor is green.
- Hide vendor contact details to fight leakage.
- Auto-award cheapest. Ever.
- Leave a live-looking fake job on the public book.
- Publish support hours you cannot cover.
- Put Death Care Repair, Standridge, or mechanic45 on a TradeBook surface.
- Use 205-681-9122 as the TradeBook number.
- Spend on ads, X, TikTok, Display, or ASO before 20 real awards.
- Promise escrow of remains or guarantee workmanship.
- Buy a national funeral-home list and cold-email it.
- Quote 1,000 users as a year-one number.


